{"id":23048,"name":"金血铭刻的时代","rarity":5,"path":"Shaman","desc":"同谐命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「千年后，历史将如何铭记刻律德菈？」</i>\\n她曾如此被人问道。\\n\\n有人心中，她是赫赫威名的「凯撒」。\\n那冰冷残酷的暴君，那野心勃勃的「燃冕者」，那以血与火烧尽旧时代的女皇……\\n\\n有人反驳，她只是一枚可怜的「棋子」。\\n这众叛亲离的君王不过是野心的囚徒，在那场与神明对决的棋局中，她注定只能满盘皆输。\\n\\n也有人说，在那比海更幽暗的内心深处，她只是一个名为「刻律德菈」的凡人——\\n她也会为死难的同伴哀悼，也会在沉重的使命前犹疑畏惧，止步不前……\\n\\n<i>「呵，无需历史将我铭记……」</i>\\n\\n她咽下心头苦涩，继续行在那由牺牲铺就的逐火之路——\\n\\n<i>「是吾等燃烧的金血，铭刻了它！」</i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23048,"name":"征服","desc":"使装备者的攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。施放终结技攻击后恢复<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>个战技点，装备者对我方单体角色施放战技后，使目标造成的战技伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[f1]%</unbreak></color>，持续<unbreak>#5[i]</unbreak>回合。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.64,1,1,0.54,3]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.8,1,1,0.675,3]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.96,1,1,0.81,3]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[1.12,1,1,0.945,3]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[1.28,1,1,1.08,3]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":28.8,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":115011,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":63.36,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110231,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115011,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":109.44,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115012,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":155.52,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":115012,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":201.6,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":147,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":1